{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_6000_situation", "source_sha256": "9b0b106f073d730c4bf46b23a439afa5608af1a86a41006386f2490d06b2a126", "ja": "商品のPR撮影", "zh": "商品的宣传拍摄", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_6000_place", "source_sha256": "7dbb1fe5e39aba394291cd2ec6a4dc97bb9d43c260a409d3beecadfc72a7a404", "ja": "にんじんジュース屋前", "zh": "胡萝卜汁店前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_6001_p", "source_sha256": "ae98295e1ad115dfbbf746a216e6da63dff316d314e27f6f169afca404a6cebf", "ja": "（今日のグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影は、\nにんじんジュースとのコラボだ。育も楽しそうだ！）", "zh": "（今天的写真杂志《偶像写真！！》拍摄，是和胡萝卜汁的联动。育看起来也很开心！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_6002_030iku", "source_sha256": "fbaecc88dc1807fe011d88cfe2eed7de7ad8e0c25e349dc8385db06d439eacba", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、にんじんジュース\nもう飲んだ？　スッキリしてて、おいしいよ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生喝过胡萝卜汁了吗？\n口感很清爽，非常好喝哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_6003_p", "source_sha256": "ffa0c7f543c30db106e0130da0981f23c6c18532788ba3bffc3c4de80ce61f98", "ja": "ああ、さっき飲んだよ。\nフルーツジュースみたいな甘さで、飲みやすかったな。", "zh": "啊，我刚才喝过了。\n甜得像果汁一样，很容易入口。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_6004_030iku", "source_sha256": "19884d1e16fde86601ec521857e660f14d941e359a1c5205c0381b8c6037f06d", "ja": "うん！　こんなにおいしいなら、\nにんじんが苦手な子も、飲めるかな？", "zh": "嗯！这么好喝的话，\n不喜欢胡萝卜的孩子也能喝吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_6005_p", "source_sha256": "71a1c2953e665f09a6481673192a30be89cd79bf0412534e42060a51e6bc48e0", "ja": "そうだな。でもその前に、「飲んでみたい」って\n興味をもってもらうことが大事かもな。", "zh": "是啊。不过在那之前，或许最重要的是先让他们产生“想喝喝看”的兴趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_6006_030iku", "source_sha256": "f655af292d2272a34b2666e4de72d24cbd090f0e240f2b24670f3eef5f906108", "ja": "そっか……。苦手だから飲まない子も多いよね。\nでも飲んでくれたら、ぜーったい好きになると思う！", "zh": "这样啊……。因为不喜欢，所以不喝的孩子也很多呢。\n不过只要愿意喝，我觉得绝对会喜欢上的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_6007_030iku", "source_sha256": "cf3c38d56b00e461f4108febfd830bf3dba0d5e592a1a8eacf5725bd610ac21c", "ja": "わたし、がんばってアピールしてみるね！\n写真をみた人が、ジュースを飲みたくなるように！", "zh": "我会努力宣传的！\n希望看到照片的人都想喝果汁！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_6008_030iku", "source_sha256": "7c30dc0d7042406a91c6b4d2dc8d409802e0d495c355d166fb8d7c621328d697", "ja": "でも……どうしたらうまく伝えられるかな？\n教えて、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "可是……要怎么做才能好好表达出来呢？\n教教我吧，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_6009", "source_sha256": "fb19dae04a67fc8ee7780b9f7abbdb7a4e977a70ea4e2fed2a19bf266b344f34", "ja": "全身で表現", "zh": "用全身表现", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_6010", "source_sha256": "f34a26f6ba3ab9797c06bf82aec8a4f7223770ad85d6efbcc23a1d3b25dc831f", "ja": "オリジナルソング", "zh": "原创歌曲", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_6011", "source_sha256": "c1945da4d3d766544109b1fb450843ebae557d623da7435046b4ad5e4728a25a", "ja": "気持ちを訴える", "zh": "表达心情", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_6100_p", "source_sha256": "162c234ba20bd8ef7217b6e859fe25893b77637cac2fda529a578b37fef2e6ea", "ja": "うさぎみたいに、思いきりジャンプするのはどうだ？\n全身で美味しさを表現してみるんだ。", "zh": "像小兔子一样，使劲跳起来怎么样？\n试着用全身来表现出有多好吃吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_6101_030iku", "source_sha256": "a12bdaddcce33597c4c8698b21e9be909a8a5d79d744674b544564c10a424237", "ja": "いいかも！　すごくおいしいって、わかりやすいね！\n{$P$}さん、ありがとう！", "zh": "好像很不错！这样很容易让人明白超级好吃呢！\n{$P$}先生，谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_6102_030iku", "source_sha256": "5a3fefcd830a3e45062af1f048774380b4f02532ccf06149302cc2ce8077d0a3", "ja": "よーし……にんじんジュースでハッピーチャージ！\n元気いっぱい、さつえいするぴょん♪　えへへ♪", "zh": "好——用胡萝卜汁充满幸福能量！\n精神十足地去拍摄吧♪　嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_6200_p", "source_sha256": "dbe006f20c57ba9ee5cdb9497550fccc2185c712702ef754ea7425a2b42fb25e", "ja": "親しみやすさなら、歌がいいかもしれないな。\nジュースの美味しさを歌ったにんじんソングとか。", "zh": "说到亲和力，也许用歌曲来表达会不错。\n比如唱出果汁美味的胡萝卜之歌之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_6201_030iku", "source_sha256": "da5138e704bb1dc8fcaee2083779dc32ed85c84c7d8b8e4e0dd5404958827e66", "ja": "にんじんソング……。えーっと「魔法のおいしさ～♪\nにんじんジュ～ス～♪」……こんな感じでどうかな？", "zh": "胡萝卜之歌……呃——“魔法般的美味～♪  \n胡萝卜果～汁～♪”……像这样怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_6202_030iku", "source_sha256": "26f6fb4a0ebe16bc001457415f5500ccfcfd7a3a18b1f0346f9df61c3939f473", "ja": "でも、おいしいって気持ちが足りないかも。\nわたし、もっともっとにんじんソング考えてみるね！", "zh": "不过，表达美味的感觉可能还不够。\n我再多想想胡萝卜之歌吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_6300_p", "source_sha256": "454088fa7c429961a2112ab91d7ffd0965085e83b747fffd2f09535890c8a51c", "ja": "にんじんジュースの気持ちになって、\nみんなの心に訴えてみるのはどうだろう？", "zh": "站在胡萝卜汁的立场上，试着打动大家怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_6301_030iku", "source_sha256": "a10680b42beb47bf33a4cd860cf89373433fbe4362a4574e3284f1723e50604f", "ja": "にんじんジュースになって……。「甘くて、\nとってもおいしいよ！　みんなもたくさん飲んでね♪」", "zh": "变成胡萝卜汁……“甜甜的，\n特别好喝！大家也要多喝点哦♪”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_6302_030iku", "source_sha256": "59030b38efa762adfe756aa2fb8e1f5c0e62b4ffe975d2ff610a6614a2fcc654", "ja": "うーん、なんか違う気がする……。\nにんじんの気持ちを考えるのも、むずかしいなぁ。", "zh": "嗯——总觉得好像不太对……。\n要考虑胡萝卜的心情，也好难啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
